59	 *
60	 * @brief Helper class to create URAM array that can be updated every cycle
61	 * with forwarding regs.
62	 *
63	 * Forwarding regs keeps a history of address and values, and when acess to URAM
64	 * hits the "cache", read from URAM is skipped. This addresses the
65	 * Read-After-Write dependency across iterations. The depth of the cache,
66	 * specified with the ``_NCache`` variable, dependes on the latency of actual
67	 * write. It is suggested to be set after initial sythesis attempts.
68	 *
